---
import { homepage, site } from "@data/site";
---

<section class="founder" id="about" aria-labelledby="founder-title">
  <div class="container founder__layout">
    <header>
      <p class="founder__index">08 / Founder accountability</p>
      <h2 id="founder-title">The person defining the work stays accountable for how it is carried out</h2>
      <p>
        {site.founder.name}, {site.founder.title}, is directly involved in scope
        review, project planning, communication, and operating oversight.
      </p>
    </header>

    <blockquote>
      <p>
        “Difficult properties are not handled well through vague promises.
        Before work begins, I want you to know what is included, what is
        excluded, what happens when something unexpected is found, and what you
        will receive when the job is closed. That is the standard I built
        Aseptaclean around.”
      </p>
      <footer>
        <strong>{site.founder.name}</strong>
        <span>{site.founder.title}</span>
      </footer>
    </blockquote>

    <div class="founder__record">
      <p>Relevant operating background</p>
      <ul>
        {homepage.founderCredentials.map((credential) => <li>{credential}</li>)}
      </ul>
      <small>
        This background does not grant contractor, remediation, medical,
        environmental, biohazard, or regulatory authority.
      </small>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder {
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    background: var(--color-warm-white);
  }

  .founder__layout {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-7);
  }

  .founder__index,
  .founder__record > p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-blue-500);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h2 {
    max-width: 20ch;
    margin: var(--space-4) 0 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  header > p:last-child {
    max-width: 37rem;
    margin: var(--space-5) 0 0;
  }

  blockquote {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--color-navy-900);
    padding-top: var(--space-6);
  }

  blockquote::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    color: var(--color-steel-300);
    content: "“";
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 7rem;
    line-height: 0.72;
  }

  blockquote > p {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 25ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-navy-900);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  blockquote footer {
    display: grid;
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
  }

  blockquote strong {
    color: var(--color-navy-900);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
  }

  blockquote span {
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .founder__record {
    align-self: start;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-steel-300);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    background: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .founder__record ul {
    margin: var(--space-4) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .founder__record li {
    max-width: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    padding-block: var(--space-3);
  }

  .founder__record small {
    display: block;
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-blue-500);
    padding-left: var(--space-3);
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (min-width: 70rem) {
    .founder__layout {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(21rem, 5fr) minmax(20rem, 4fr) minmax(18rem, 3fr);
      align-items: start;
      gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    }

    blockquote {
      margin-top: var(--space-8);
    }
  }
</style>
